  (text "12 V in: reverse protection D25, TVS D26, LM2596 buck to 5 V, AMS1117 to 3.3 V. D28 lets the DevKitC USB power the logic for bench tests."
    (at 20 100 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "c7003246-0306-4956-9d87-15a0ab173f0f")
  )
  (text "ESP32 DevKitC V4 (38 pins) in two 1x19 sockets. RMII pins are fixed by the ESP32: TXD0 19, TXD1 22, TXEN 21, RXD0 25, RXD1 26, CRS_DV 27, MDC 23, MDIO 18, 50 MHz reference clock in on GPIO0 (from the PHY)."
    (at 200 130 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "0a6ca2cc-a632-4932-9906-2624697b72d6")
  )
  (text "Shift registers: SER 13, SRCLK 16, RCLK 32, OE 4 (pulled up: all relays off until the program starts). PHY reset 33. I2C 15/14. Analog 34/35."
    (at 200 136 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "f040dc56-b470-4436-8c75-40f7cc486062")
  )
  (text "RTL8201F on a 25 MHz crystal (Y1, C34/C35); the 50 MHz RMII clock comes OUT of TXC -> R30 -> GPIO0 (ETH_CLOCK_GPIO0_IN). R33 keeps the PHY in reset until GPIO33 is high, so GPIO0 is free at boot."
    (at 330 190 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "5691c261-ea11-46b5-9389-4d46b026f5b8")
  )
  (text "Straps: RXDV up (R35) = RMII; LED0/LED1 down (R32/R36) = PHY address 0, LEDs active high: D30 = 10 Mbit link/activity, D31 = 100 Mbit (default LED mode). RSET 2.49 k (R31). 49.9 ohm terminations to 3.3 V (R38-R41)."
    (at 330 196 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "7275e44c-86ce-413d-9830-f57b6eada702")
  )
  (text "RJ45 HR911105A: PHY pair 0 (transmit) on pins 1-2, pair 1 (receive) on 3-6, centre taps (4, 5, 7, 8) to 3.3 V with C36/C37, its own LEDs unused."
